# RC-011 — Experience Orchestrator

North star: **Screens request experience. The orchestrator decides. UI never contains business logic.**

## Before adding experience logic ask

- Does the decision live in a decider or `ExperienceOrchestrator` — not in a widget?
- Does the screen consume `ExperienceContext` — not compute greeting/highlight logic inline?
- Does data flow through `ReflectionEngineService` and intelligence layer — not direct AI/storage?
- Can future modules extend via `ExperienceSignalProvider` without modifying existing deciders?

If any answer is no — revise.

## Canonical doc

`docs/RC-011.md`

## Out of scope

Redesign · navigation changes · unfinished UI exposure

## Success

Nothing visible today. One central brain coordinates every future experience.
